  "description": "<p data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"299\">De Lenco MC-020 is een compacte <strong data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"88\">radio speaker</strong> met ondersteuning voor DAB+ en FM, ideaal voor dagelijks gebruik in huis. Dankzij het moderne ontwerp en het duidelijke display luister je eenvoudig naar je favoriete radiostations met heldere geluidskwaliteit.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"417\">Deze radio is geschikt voor in de keuken, slaapkamer of op kantoor en combineert gebruiksgemak met een strak design.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"422\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"435\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"454\"><strong data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"454\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"459\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"476\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"628\">\r\n<li data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"519\">\r\n<p data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"519\">📻 Ondersteuning voor DAB+ en FM radio</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"550\">\r\n<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"550\">🔊 Helder en zuiver geluid</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"576\">\r\n<p data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"576\">🖥️ Duidelijk display</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"605\">\r\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"605\">🎛️ Eenvoudige bediening</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"628\">\r\n<p data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"628\">🏠 Compact formaat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"633\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"655\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"844\">\r\n<li data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"671\">\r\n<p data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"671\">Merk: Lenco</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"689\">\r\n<p data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"689\">Model: MC-020</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"713\">\r\n<p data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"713\">Type: Radio speaker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n<p data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"737\">Ontvangst: DAB+, FM</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"758\">\r\n<p data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"758\">Vermogen: 2 x 5W</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"784\">\r\n<p data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"784\">Aansluitingen: AUX-in</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"801\">\r\n<p data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"801\">Display: LCD</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"818\">\r\n<p data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"818\">Kleur: Zwart</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"844\">\r\n<p data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"844\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"849\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"869\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"918\">\r\n<li data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"900\">Lenco MC-020 radio speaker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"918\">\r\n<p data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"918\">Voedingskabel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"923\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"949\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"986\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"986\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</strong></p>",
